  "prefLabel": "Arch 403.06 Requirements for Applicants Licensed in Another Jurisdiction",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Arch 403.06 Requirements for Applicants Licensed in Another Jurisdiction. Licensees who are residents of jurisdictions other than New Hampshire shall have equivalent or higher standards than New Hampshire, as required in Plc 313.16.\n\nSource. #12847, eff 8-14-19; ss by #14492, eff 3-24-26, EXPIRES: 3-24-36 (formerly Arch 403.08)",
